{"version":1,"content":"<p>天文台表示，本港明日（16日）預測日間部分時間有陽光。</p><p>氣溫介乎26至30°C。</p><p>明晚有一兩陣微雨。</p><p>吹和緩東風，風勢間中清勁。</p><p>展望周六（17日）有一兩陣雨。</p><p>重陽節（18日）初時雲量仍然較多，稍後至下周初漸轉天晴乾燥。</p><p>下周中期日間炎熱。</p><p>（天文台）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T14:00:09.662080+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T13:35:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:38:00.856103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T13:58:04.534149+00:00","content_hash":"e3c87fb08e8546c2b7ca67787183c7dc313a6804544d2ed91ec2d31f1276889c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}